*VERSION: 3.0
*WRITTEN_BY: openair-conformance
* Tests: a ring-shaped airspace with an empty area inside. The boundary is the outer ring (clockwise), a connecting line to the inner ring, the inner ring (counter-clockwise) and the same connecting line back. The boundary touches itself on the connecting line, but it does not cross itself.

AC UNC
AY CUSTOM
AN Outside competition area
AH FL95
AL GND
DP 46:30:00N 013:40:00E * outer ring, clockwise
DP 46:32:00N 014:20:00E
DP 46:10:00N 014:35:00E
DP 45:50:00N 014:20:00E
DP 45:48:00N 013:45:00E
DP 46:30:00N 013:40:00E * back to the start of the outer ring
DP 46:15:00N 013:55:00E * connecting line to the inner ring
DP 46:00:00N 013:55:00E * inner ring, counter-clockwise
DP 46:00:00N 014:15:00E
DP 46:15:00N 014:15:00E
DP 46:15:00N 013:55:00E * back to the start of the inner ring
DP 46:30:00N 013:40:00E * the same connecting line back, closes the boundary
